.TH geectl-gitea-repo-create 1  "geectl-gitea-repo-create 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-repo\-create \- Create a repository under the token owner\*(Aqs account. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the creation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea repo\-create\fR [\fB\-\-private\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-default\-branch\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a repository under the token owner\*(Aqs account. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the creation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-private\fR
Create a private repository; public by default
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
A short description
.TP
\fB\-\-default\-branch\fR \fI<DEFAULT_BRANCH>\fR
The default branch; the server default when unset
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The repository name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
